@Paperless.REST_HostAddress = http://localhost:5252
@documentId = 1

### Upload an original document file
POST {{Paperless.REST_HostAddress}}/api/Documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=PaperlessBoundary

--PaperlessBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="meeting-notes.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

# Meeting Notes
Agenda and decisions.
--PaperlessBoundary
--PaperlessBoundary--

### List document metadata
GET {{Paperless.REST_HostAddress}}/api/Documents
Accept: application/json

### Download the original file
GET {{Paperless.REST_HostAddress}}/api/Documents/{{documentId}}/file

### Replace the original file
PUT {{Paperless.REST_HostAddress}}/api/Documents/{{documentId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=PaperlessBoundary

--PaperlessBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="updated-notes.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

Updated notes.
--PaperlessBoundary--

### Delete a document
DELETE {{Paperless.REST_HostAddress}}/api/Documents/{{documentId}}
